  "content": "<div>\n    <img\n    width=\"100%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\"\n    alt=\"特色功能\"\n  />\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:center; max-width:100%; margin:0 auto;\">\n<img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8aoMKplv/images/81fcb56d7fc54db831facf5febbdd1e021bb7fcc.gif\" alt=\"锄头动作\" style=\"flex:1 1 45%; margin:2px;\"/>\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n<div align=\"center\">\n  \n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/CXttaCyGCN\">\n  <img alt=\"Discord\" width=\"60px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25b3523cedf0cb3f3c12740f07400b5bc306954b.png\">\n</a><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@mypunchymod\">\n  <img alt=\"TikTok\" width=\"60px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c455866e8b8d992e586e9d61e5cd905dcc6c84de.png\">\n</a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@punchyxp2\">\n  <img alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"60px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c6ea4d87bf707d2f9f0bf59633d29ebede5c9fd7.png\">\n</a><a href=\"https://github.com/punchy-mod/punchy-wiki/wiki/\">\n  <img alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"60px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0197a0dce279690de37a1f899b3d25edf9d3bac2.png\">\n</a><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/modinpunchy\">\n  <img alt=\"Ko-fi\" width=\"60px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8a0c2971228a3266c56e4dcdeef1229af0974192.png\">\n</a>\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n<section>\n  <p>\n    <img width=\"120px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8aoMKplv/images/81fcb56d7fc54db831facf5febbdd1e021bb7fcc.gif\" alt=\"锄头动作\" style=\"flex:1 1 45%; margin:2px;\"/>改变了《我的世界》中战斗和移动的体验。流畅的动画、手持物理效果以及实时调整，为每个动作增添了重量感、风格和个性。它的设计让一切显得生动，同时不破坏资源包的兼容性。\n  </p>\n</section>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <iframe \n    width=\"560\" \n    height=\"315\" \n    src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dvTgIbiwHqc?autoplay=1&mute=1\" \n    title=\"YouTube 视频播放器\" \n    frameborder=\"0\" \n    allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture\" \n    allowfullscreen>\n  </iframe>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin:6px 0;\">\n    <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\" alt=\"特色功能\"/>\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"margin:2px 0 4px 0;\">\n  <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/punchy\">\n    <img \n      width=\"750\"\n      src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d205b6380c63f1e8d075fbcd727d40dcdee15c0b.webp\" \n      alt=\"Punchy × Bisect Hosting 横幅\"\n    />\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<!-- 横幅下方的分隔线 -->\n<div style=\"margin:4px 0 6px 0;\">\n  <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\" alt=\"特色功能\"/>\n</div>\n<br>\n<br>\n<img width=\"30%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47e0f59a12115269646e828a6f7c65f7139efce1.webp\" alt=\"更好的战斗\">\n<br>\n<br>\n<img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8aoMKplv/images/3a29acf139bff97b6abe147602ee3b7aea626620.gif\" alt=\"更好的战斗\">\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"max-width:900px; margin:0 auto; text-align:center;\">\n  <p>\n    为了与 Better Combat 附加组件获得<b>最佳兼容性</b>，请使用此资源包：\n  </p>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/punchy!-compatibility\">\n    <img width=\"80px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b5b655780b2e2a45f484af6e93f268e0c677357c.png\" alt=\"特色功能\" />\n  </a>\n  <br>\n  <i>点击查看</i>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin:6px 0;\">\n    <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\" alt=\"特色功能\"/>\n</div>\n<br>\n<br>\n<div>\n    <img width=\"300px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9c571a5ef1176c92ce66a7157c33dd1779420632.png\" alt=\"特色功能\"/>\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"max-width:900px; margin:0 auto; text-align:center;\">\n  <p>\n    与其使用单独的资源包，<br>所有<b>明确的 Punchy! 兼容性功能</b>都集中维护在单个 Modrinth 收藏集中。\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    此收藏集持续更新，并包含官方推荐的兼容包。\n  </p>\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"margin:16px 0;\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/collection/GypBAs4y\">\n    <img width=\"320\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1295a4a95570fdd19437f2af3d6edb9ef0cf9cd1_0.webp\" alt=\"Punchy! 兼容性收藏集\" />\n  </a>\n  <p style=\"margin-top:6px;\"><i>点击查看完整的 Modrinth 收藏集</i></p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin:6px 0;\">\n    <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\" alt=\"特色功能\"/>\n</div>\n<br>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img width=\"400px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2bb0d76282288d92aa6d210cac2db4384ac8f439.png\" alt=\"特色功能\" />\n\n<section>\n  <h3>鸣谢</h3>\n  感谢 Godku 提供的所有帮助。<br>\n  感谢 Jaredlll08 提供的多加载器模板：\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/jaredlll08\">Jaredlll08 GitHub 页面</a><br>\n  感谢 Lunggolfs 提供的社交连接图标包：\n  <a href=\"https://lunggolfs.itch.io/social-connect-icons-pack\">Lunggolfs 网站</a><br>\n  感谢 CRV6 制作的预告片和精彩的音乐：\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@CRV6-Music/featured\">CRV6 YouTube 频道</a><br>\n  感谢 Craftandoof 制作的超棒起床动画：\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/craftandoof\">Craftandoof Modrinth 资料页</a><br>\n  感谢 themodderg 设计的简洁醒目的模组图标：\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/themodderg\">themodderg Modrinth 资料页</a><br>\n  感谢 choccy_milk55 制作的炫酷模组开场动画：\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/choccy_milk55\">choccy_milk55 Modrinth 资料页</a>\n</section>\n\n<section>\n  <h3>许可协议</h3>\n  ARR（保留所有权利）<br>\n  允许将此模组包含在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 的整合包中，无需事先请求许可。<br>\n  禁止重新分发 jar 文件。\n</section>\n\n</div>",
